{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1109691-fae-realm","id":1109691,"title":"Fae Realm","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-30T04:32:24-07:00","id":1109691,"title":"Fae Realm","content":"I continue in my overview of C20 as I read it, and react to the changes brought, and to the changes that were not made.<br /> <br /> I would have liked the Fae Realm to be changed to<br /> <br /> Fae 1: Manifold Chimera<br /> <br /> Fae 2: Hearty Commoner<br /> <br /> Fae 3: Lofty Noble<br /> <br /> Fae 4: Elusive Gallain<br /> <br /> Fae 5: Dweomer of Glamour.<br /> <br /> My rational is this: chimera are much less complex, more simple, creatures of the Dreaming than fae, whether commoner or noble.<br /> <br /> Don't you agree?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T05:43:28-07:00","id":1109712,"title":"","content":"I've thought Fae and Actor (unlike Props and Nature [Complexity] or Time and Scene[Scae]) are about degrees of familiarity. Also, chimeras can be as simple as a character's veil or ambient dream stuff - basic concepts and emotions, easy to interpret to so ancient or relevant or deep, that some Kiths pale in comparison.<br /> <br /> Although, I'm not against the idea. You do you and see what happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"us